  "details": "Not just recently visited. I don’t know if there’s even a way to implement this, but having access to a complete list of visited worlds would be a game changer, even if it’s just a text list on the site itself. There are worlds I went to with friends months ago and would like to visit again, but none of us remembered to favorite them so they’re just lost to us. Now I’m trying to find them again, but struggling because all I have to go by are memories of what the places looked like.",
